1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Third Episode
Deadly Challenge

15
00:02:07,208 --> 00:02:08,421
Well done!

16
00:02:10,314 --> 00:02:10,912

Enough with the training dummies today!

17
00:02:11,861 --> 00:02:13,533
So exhausting...!

18
00:02:44,861 --> 00:02:47,898
Good morning, Prince!
I was watching you.

19
00:02:48,821 --> 00:02:50,812
Take a look at this sword!

20
00:02:50,861 --> 00:02:52,772
Is there something wrong with it?

21
00:02:52,821 --> 00:02:56,257
Yes! Your master is using a real
sword for practice.

22
00:02:56,301 --> 00:02:58,417
It is indeed very strange.

23
00:02:58,541 --> 00:03:02,739
Tell me, since when do they use
real swords for training?

24
00:03:02,781 --> 00:03:04,665
Well, Grand Duke, you see...

25
00:03:04,689 --> 00:03:05,534
You are fired!

26
00:03:05,581 --> 00:03:06,698
At your command!

27
00:03:08,021 --> 00:03:10,899
Prince, for tomorrow I have
organized a grand tournament

28
00:03:10,941 --> 00:03:13,296
Since you are here,
would you like to participate?

29
00:03:14,061 --> 00:03:18,100
The most skilled knights
who tread our lands will participate!

30
00:03:23,781 --> 00:03:25,340
Officer of the guard, announce me!

31
00:03:25,701 --> 00:03:28,261
Damn! This knight
seems really very strong!

32
00:03:29,021 --> 00:03:32,297
People of the castle, make way
for the certain winner of the tournament!

33
00:03:32,322 --> 00:03:33,830
No one will manage to defeat me!

34
00:03:43,621 --> 00:03:46,379
Damn it! Ruffians!

35
00:03:46,404 --> 00:03:49,015
Is this how you treat the best
knight you invited?

36
00:03:51,234 --> 00:03:54,431
I disqualify you for incompetence!
Go back to your lands!

37
00:03:55,741 --> 00:03:59,290
My name is Baron! I have come
for the tournament! How dare you?!

38
00:04:04,021 --> 00:04:05,818
Get lost!

39
00:04:26,274 --> 00:04:28,306
You will be convinced, I hope,
that I am the strongest!

40
00:04:28,541 --> 00:04:30,053
It will be difficult to beat him!

41
00:04:30,821 --> 00:04:33,983
This knight has what it takes
to win the tournament.

42
00:04:34,321 --> 00:04:38,102
He will surely also win the challenge
against Sapphire and kill him!

43
00:04:39,507 --> 00:04:43,192
Kill Sapphire?! I must warn him
of the danger he is facing!

44
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:46,011
Stork friends, I need you!

45
00:05:10,861 --> 00:05:13,160
I have a feeling they
won't let children in.

46
00:05:13,185 --> 00:05:15,661
I'll hide in here and
enter with this lady.

47
00:05:16,821 --> 00:05:17,541
He's stealing my lunch!
Little thief!

48
00:05:25,461 --> 00:05:27,895
Guard, I am the knight Baron!

49
00:05:27,941 --> 00:05:29,738
Welcome, knight!
Please, enter!

50
00:05:31,221 --> 00:05:33,291
I will be the only one to come out!

51
00:05:33,661 --> 00:05:35,811
I am the knight Guillon!

52
00:05:41,287 --> 00:05:43,129
Well, you are here too!

53
00:05:43,181 --> 00:05:45,411
Look, look!
My dear enemy Baron!

54
00:05:45,461 --> 00:05:48,021
- Do you hope to win?
- The scar you gave me

55
00:05:48,061 --> 00:05:51,133
..cries out for revenge! I can't wait
to run you through with my sword!

56
00:05:51,181 --> 00:05:54,014
The hatred I bear you for the mark
that you left on my face...

57
00:05:54,061 --> 00:05:56,450
..makes me wish for
the very same thing!

58
00:05:56,501 --> 00:05:57,450
I will kill two birds with one stone:

59
00:05:57,747 --> 00:06:00,616
I will send you to hell
and I will win the tournament too!

60
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,516
Easy!

61
00:06:05,621 --> 00:06:07,612
They scare me...

62
00:06:14,386 --> 00:06:17,133
I am Prince Sapphire!
I thank all the knights..

63
00:06:17,180 --> 00:06:19,908
...who have gathered for this tournament.
I will fight you as equals!

64
00:06:19,933 --> 00:06:22,657
Do not be deceived
by my apparent fragility

65
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:24,817
nor by the fact
that I am only a boy

66
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:26,897
nor have any qualms about fighting
against a Prince,

67
00:06:26,940 --> 00:06:28,111
because I am much stronger
than I appear.

68
00:06:40,433 --> 00:06:41,378
What is there to laugh about?

69
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:45,100
Did you see?!

70
00:06:45,140 --> 00:06:47,655
You are very strong
for a boy!

71
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,260
You had better not laugh anymore!

72
00:06:53,773 --> 00:06:56,242
That fool of a Prince
doesn't know how dangerous it is...

73
00:06:56,300 --> 00:06:59,293
...to provoke those knights!
Now, without a doubt, one of them

74
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:01,730
..can't wait
to tear him to pieces!

75
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:07,015
I declare open
the Silverland tournament!

76
00:07:07,060 --> 00:07:09,097
Grand Duke Duralumin
will present the competition!

77
00:07:09,140 --> 00:07:14,698
My friends... I wish
you all the best of luck!

78
00:07:14,740 --> 00:07:17,016
And expressing the thoughts
of the Prince and myself,

79
00:07:17,060 --> 00:07:18,157
I urge you to fight
to the death!

80
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:23,891
We will immediately begin the tournament
with three elimination rounds!

81
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:27,820
Those who emerge as victors
will be admitted to the final challenge!

82
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:30,011
Good luck to you, knights

83
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:37,018
Go!

84
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:52,616
The knight missed two shots!

85
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:55,819
The next contestant
is Prince Sapphire!

86
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:59,180
Careful, Sapphire!
If you make it to the final contest,

87
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:00,541
you will be killed by the knights!

88
00:08:17,413 --> 00:08:19,245
You're the best!

89
00:08:22,540 --> 00:08:24,186
Prince Sapphire
has missed two...

90
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:30,809
He didn't miss a single shot!

91
00:08:50,941 --> 00:08:53,853
Also qualifying is
the knight Guillon!

92
00:08:56,101 --> 00:08:59,013
The second round,
gentlewomen and noblemen,

93
00:08:59,061 --> 00:09:00,767
consists of the shooting contest
with the crossbow!

94
00:09:16,021 --> 00:09:17,821
The Prince
has hit the target!

95
00:09:28,341 --> 00:09:32,180
The next challenge will consist
of the axe throw!

96
00:09:52,101 --> 00:09:53,926
Wow, he did it!
It's amazing!

97
00:10:06,421 --> 00:10:07,173
Sapphire!

98
00:10:07,197 --> 00:10:08,582
Hello, Tink! What happened to you?

99
00:10:08,607 --> 00:10:10,736
You are so dirty
that I have to wash you a bit.

100
00:10:13,741 --> 00:10:16,460
Did you see the tournament?
It went well for me, don't you think?

101
00:10:16,501 --> 00:10:18,810
I don't think you should be
very happy.

102
00:10:18,861 --> 00:10:21,216
Listen, it would be better
if you withdrew.

103
00:10:21,261 --> 00:10:24,253
Do your head and stomach
happen to hurt a bit?

104
00:10:24,301 --> 00:10:26,292
I'm sorry, Tink,
but I feel perfectly fine.

105
00:10:26,341 --> 00:10:29,420
Still, it would be better for you

106
00:10:30,561 --> 00:10:31,532
Why are you telling me this?

107
00:10:31,683 --> 00:10:33,303
They will kill you!

108
00:10:33,327 --> 00:10:36,381
I know that Duralumin wants to have me
killed during the race.

109
00:10:36,381 --> 00:10:38,101
And isn't that a good reason
to give it up?

110
00:10:38,541 --> 00:10:40,418
I'll survive, don't worry

111
00:10:40,461 --> 00:10:43,021
I won't let you participate
in the final race!

112
00:10:47,021 --> 00:10:49,819
There are seven knights who have
passed the qualifiers.

113
00:10:49,861 --> 00:10:52,091
They are about to
fight for the final victory.

114
00:10:53,181 --> 00:10:55,741
They will certainly be
strong enough.

115
00:10:55,781 --> 00:10:58,249
Oh, yes! Strong enough
for the Prince!

116
00:10:58,301 --> 00:11:02,180
I am sure that one of them will certainly
end up defeating him, Grand Duke.

117
00:11:02,221 --> 00:11:05,133
But from the first matches we've
seen that Prince Sapphire, too...

118
00:11:05,181 --> 00:11:08,014
...is rather strong,
so we cannot be sure.

119
00:11:08,038 --> 00:11:09,915
Do you see this bag of gold?

120
00:11:10,537 --> 00:11:11,543
What is the meaning of this?

121
00:11:12,101 --> 00:11:15,889
The Grand Duke will give it to
whoever eliminates all the opponents.

122
00:11:16,701 --> 00:11:20,057
I have participated in many
tournaments and I have always won.

123
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:22,849
Then would you be willing
to do a favor for the Grand Duke,

124
00:11:22,901 --> 00:11:24,380
by killing one of the competitors?

125
00:11:24,404 --> 00:11:25,221
Of course! And who would that be?

126
00:11:25,759 --> 00:11:27,172
The boy, Prince Sapphire.

127
00:11:27,996 --> 00:11:29,211
The Prince?

128
00:11:30,541 --> 00:11:32,867
Here are two bags!
If you kill him, you will have more.

129
00:11:32,892 --> 00:11:35,521
You can give them to me right now,
because I will kill him.

130
00:11:35,546 --> 00:11:37,817
Good! Good luck!

131
00:11:38,381 --> 00:11:39,465
Hey, Baron!

132
00:11:41,021 --> 00:11:43,396
Sir Baron, you disappoint me.

133
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:44,716
And why is that?

134
00:11:45,341 --> 00:11:48,581
Would you kill an opponent
for a bit of vile money?

135
00:11:50,541 --> 00:11:54,133
I am a professional
and I am at the service of whoever pays me!

136
00:11:54,901 --> 00:11:57,996
Mercenaries like you are not
worthy of fighting with knights.

137
00:11:58,847 --> 00:11:59,940
Damn it! Do you want a lesson?

138
00:11:59,965 --> 00:12:03,205
See you soon, Baron!

139
00:12:03,229 --> 00:12:04,098
Damned Guillon!

140
00:12:05,927 --> 00:12:08,476
Knights,
here we are at the grand finale!

141
00:12:08,501 --> 00:12:12,531
I warn you that from now on you can
kill your opponent...

142
00:12:12,581 --> 00:12:14,024
without being punished!

143
00:12:15,581 --> 00:12:18,618
For the first match, on this
side, the knight Mustang,

144
00:12:18,661 --> 00:12:22,176
on this other side, His Highness
Prince Sapphire!

145
00:12:22,221 --> 00:12:24,212
Sapphire, don't go! He will kill you!

146
00:12:24,261 --> 00:12:26,259
Don't worry, Tink!
You'll see I'll make it! Move aside!

147
00:12:31,387 --> 00:12:33,500
Prince, are you fighting without a helmet?

148
00:12:34,021 --> 00:12:35,266
I don't need it!

149
00:12:35,487 --> 00:12:36,883
Presumptuous daredevil!

150
00:12:38,927 --> 00:12:40,412
Come on, Opal! Forward!

151
00:13:05,914 --> 00:13:06,892
Take that!

152
00:13:08,694 --> 00:13:09,111
Come at me!

153
00:13:16,641 --> 00:13:17,650
You are defeated,
Mustang! I won, Grand Duke!

154
00:13:20,907 --> 00:13:25,090
The next clash will take place
between knights Baron and Hook!

155
00:13:41,047 --> 00:13:42,065
He is certainly dead.

156
00:13:43,607 --> 00:13:47,141
The next challenge will be held
between knights Guillon and Napal!

157
00:14:01,261 --> 00:14:02,198
And this one is dead too

158
00:14:03,501 --> 00:14:04,196
The next fight.

159
00:14:06,421 --> 00:14:08,024
I'm sorry,
the fight has already taken place.

160
00:14:08,827 --> 00:14:10,688
These challenges are truly
to the death.

161
00:14:10,974 --> 00:14:13,576
If you are afraid,
you can withdraw from the tournament.

162
00:14:13,621 --> 00:14:14,731
I won't back down!

163
00:14:14,755 --> 00:14:15,846
If you want, feel free to withdraw.

164
00:14:15,871 --> 00:14:18,471
You shouldn't dig your heels in
out of pride.

165
00:14:18,781 --> 00:14:19,629
But I want to...

166
00:14:19,653 --> 00:14:21,500
Sapphire, don't fight!

167
00:14:21,541 --> 00:14:22,123
Shut up, Tink!

168
00:14:22,147 --> 00:14:24,174
Sapphire, please don't do it!

169
00:14:31,490 --> 00:14:32,490
Sapphire.

170
00:14:33,110 --> 00:14:34,110
Yes, Mother?

171
00:14:35,341 --> 00:14:37,218
Sapphire! I didn't come
to watch the tournament...

172
00:14:37,261 --> 00:14:39,446
...because I was too afraid
that something would happen to you.

173
00:14:39,471 --> 00:14:43,316
Please, be satisfied with having
already won against the other contests.

174
00:14:43,341 --> 00:14:45,297
Listen, mother...

175
00:14:45,341 --> 00:14:48,094
I am the Prince and, if I give up
fighting for the victory,

176
00:14:48,141 --> 00:14:50,149
our subjects will laugh at me!
and besides...

177
00:14:50,174 --> 00:14:50,799
What else is there?

178
00:14:50,823 --> 00:14:52,690
I want to have proof..

179
00:14:52,741 --> 00:14:55,335
...that Grand Duke Duralumin
intends to kill me.

180
00:14:55,434 --> 00:14:58,857
What are you talking about?
You shouldn't say such a thing.

181
00:14:58,901 --> 00:15:01,256
I wish so much that you would
think only about studying...

182
00:15:01,301 --> 00:15:03,656
...to become a good Prince
and not about fighting!

183
00:15:03,701 --> 00:15:06,534
I love you. What will I
do if you are defeated?

184
00:15:06,581 --> 00:15:09,015
Please, take my advice!

185
00:15:11,741 --> 00:15:15,620
Mother, I promise you that after tomorrow's
contest I will go back to studying.

186
00:15:15,661 --> 00:15:17,358
May God bless you.

187
00:15:17,383 --> 00:15:18,120
I will return, mother!

188
00:15:18,144 --> 00:15:19,276
Sapphire!

189
00:15:20,181 --> 00:15:24,094
Lord of heaven, I beg you, protect her! Make sure she returns!

190
00:15:28,021 --> 00:15:30,532
Now we will form the
pairings for the two semifinals.

191
00:15:35,101 --> 00:15:38,730
The two who draw the
same card will face each other!

192
00:16:24,381 --> 00:16:25,781
I won, Grand Duke!

193
00:16:29,221 --> 00:16:31,212
You must declare me the winner!

194
00:16:32,694 --> 00:16:33,888
What are you waiting for?

195
00:16:37,341 --> 00:16:39,172
Sapphire has won!

196
00:16:46,101 --> 00:16:46,780
What?

197
00:16:47,741 --> 00:16:48,446
Referee!

198
00:16:48,471 --> 00:16:52,180
Stop the tournament!
I have to do something!

199
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:57,198
This guy?

200
00:16:57,223 --> 00:16:58,371
Yes, Grand Duke!

201
00:16:58,395 --> 00:16:59,497
Say it again!

202
00:16:59,541 --> 00:17:02,214
Well... The fact is
that Baron and Guillon...

203
00:17:02,261 --> 00:17:05,014
...have already faced each other 7 times
and have always ended in a draw.

204
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:08,500
See?

205
00:17:09,621 --> 00:17:11,179
Go on, continue!

206
00:17:11,221 --> 00:17:13,098
This time too
they won't be able to best each other!

207
00:17:13,141 --> 00:17:14,069
This is serious.

208
00:17:14,093 --> 00:17:15,291
Only this time...

209
00:17:15,341 --> 00:17:18,174
...they will fight to the death
and they will both die!

210
00:17:18,661 --> 00:17:20,777
First, the old man said
that each of those two...

211
00:17:20,821 --> 00:17:23,176
...has developed
his own secret weapon.

212
00:17:23,221 --> 00:17:26,338
This means there won't be
anyone who can kill the Prince...

213
00:17:26,381 --> 00:17:29,214
...if both of them die!
- You are right, that's how it is.

214
00:17:29,261 --> 00:17:31,254
So first we will have to
kill one of them.

215
00:17:32,621 --> 00:17:34,145
Guillon hasn't arrived yet.

216
00:17:35,021 --> 00:17:37,216
The competition is almost about to start.

217
00:17:41,901 --> 00:17:43,493
The Grand Duke asked me
to come down here.

218
00:17:44,781 --> 00:17:46,734
Who knows why he wants
to meet me in the dungeons...!

219
00:17:50,141 --> 00:17:52,609
I get it: they want to
stop me from winning!

220
00:18:07,347 --> 00:18:09,090
You may eliminate me,
but I will kill many of you!

221
00:18:09,141 --> 00:18:11,336
You have proven you are
worth as much as the strongest.

222
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:13,337
There is no need
for you to fight anymore!

223
00:18:13,381 --> 00:18:15,620
Now I can no longer back
down! I would lose face!

224
00:18:44,774 --> 00:18:47,192
Help!

225
00:18:51,181 --> 00:18:54,661
He fell into a trap! Who
did such a terrible thing?

226
00:18:54,774 --> 00:18:56,177
You say Guillon has fled?

227
00:18:56,580 --> 00:18:59,056
Yes! Probably he must
have been afraid of you!

228
00:18:59,101 --> 00:19:01,217
Impossible!
I know Guillon well!

229
00:19:01,261 --> 00:19:02,736
He is not a coward! He is brave!

230
00:19:02,947 --> 00:19:05,116
And yet we cannot find him
anywhere.

231
00:19:05,367 --> 00:19:08,613
That means you will fight in
the final match against the Prince.

232
00:19:08,661 --> 00:19:10,253
I am very perplexed.

233
00:19:10,301 --> 00:19:13,213
The Grand Duke will give you twenty
times more than what he promised you!

234
00:19:13,634 --> 00:19:15,500
Baron, did you have
Guillon killed?

235
00:19:21,901 --> 00:19:25,337
You are unfair to attack me
like this! I am not ready yet!

236
00:19:25,381 --> 00:19:26,874
Let the finale begin!

237
00:19:26,898 --> 00:19:28,047
The finale already?

238
00:19:28,072 --> 00:19:29,037
How come?

239
00:19:29,061 --> 00:19:30,541
Guillon has disappeared.

240
00:19:33,461 --> 00:19:35,372
Come on, Opal!

241
00:19:39,181 --> 00:19:40,331
Guillon has been killed!

242
00:19:40,355 --> 00:19:41,876
What do you mean he's been killed?

243
00:19:42,861 --> 00:19:44,437
You set a trap for him,
didn't you?

244
00:19:44,900 --> 00:19:46,853
Don't be foolish!
I would never do such a thing!

245
00:19:49,441 --> 00:19:51,817
I know you were afraid of Guillon!

246
00:19:51,861 --> 00:19:52,697
He feared me too!

247
00:19:52,721 --> 00:19:55,011
You are a miserable individual:

248
00:19:55,061 --> 00:19:57,253
having an opponent attacked
in the castle dungeons...!

249
00:19:59,381 --> 00:20:01,221
A trap in the dungeons?
Now I understand everything!

250
00:20:06,101 --> 00:20:08,092
Prepare for my attack!

251
00:20:18,075 --> 00:20:20,018
Oh God!

252
00:20:37,821 --> 00:20:40,460
Thank goodness, it's over!

253
00:20:40,781 --> 00:20:44,490
You deserved defeat, Baron,
because you are nothing but a schemer.

254
00:20:44,541 --> 00:20:46,452
I only want to tell you one thing,
Prince:

255
00:20:46,501 --> 00:20:48,860
You are an idiot! It wasn't me
who killed Guillon!

256
00:20:49,821 --> 00:20:51,493
What?!

257
00:20:51,541 --> 00:20:54,214
Around you live people
who try by every means...

258
00:20:54,261 --> 00:20:56,013
...to snatch your throne
and your life!

259
00:20:56,061 --> 00:20:57,011
But then, if it wasn't you,
who was it?

260
00:20:58,261 --> 00:21:01,412
Know that when I realized
who had killed Guillon,

261
00:21:01,461 --> 00:21:02,619
I pretended to lose the race!

262
00:21:02,643 --> 00:21:04,627
You could have beaten me?!

263
00:21:05,301 --> 00:21:06,917
You have too high an opinion of yourself.

264
00:21:18,820 --> 00:21:20,221
Damn it!
Baron, we will meet again!

265
00:21:29,821 --> 00:21:32,130
Baron Nylon wants to speak with you

266
00:21:32,321 --> 00:21:35,772
Baron, you let yourself be beaten
despite your promise!

267
00:21:35,796 --> 00:21:36,710
Give me my money back!

268
00:21:36,734 --> 00:21:39,018
I have no use for your money!

269
00:21:39,061 --> 00:21:42,181
And now I will kill you
to avenge Guillon!

270
00:21:57,581 --> 00:22:00,095
Forward! Forward! Kill him!

271
00:22:06,901 --> 00:22:08,619
It's the Prince!

272
00:22:08,661 --> 00:22:11,175
Good!
I was certain you would return!

273
00:22:11,221 --> 00:22:13,132
I can't stomach
that you let yourself be beaten.

274
00:22:13,181 --> 00:22:15,411
I challenge you once more
to single combat!

275
00:22:16,581 --> 00:22:18,038
It will be enough for you!

276
00:22:18,474 --> 00:22:19,744
Why don't you draw your sword?

277
00:22:20,567 --> 00:22:22,573
Let's begin!

278
00:22:37,421 --> 00:22:38,148
Are you satisfied?

279
00:22:38,172 --> 00:22:41,798
If instead of a stick I had had a
sword, I could have cut off your head

280
00:22:43,154 --> 00:22:44,725
I am a professional, Prince.

281
00:22:45,901 --> 00:22:48,653
Practice and become stronger,
otherwise you will lose your life.

282
00:22:49,274 --> 00:22:52,716
You are strong and brave
for being only a boy,

283
00:22:52,741 --> 00:22:55,175
but to defeat
the scoundrels of this kingdom

284
00:22:55,199 --> 00:22:57,656
...you will have to become
even more skilled.

285
00:22:57,679 --> 00:22:59,272
Farewell!

286
00:23:39,860 --> 00:23:43,480
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

287
00:23:43,481 --> 00:23:46,841
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

288
